Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  Final Type  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  OPERATION DATE  02 REMOVED_MONTH 93 ACCESSIONED ON  03 REMOVED_MONTH 93 at 08 59 CLINICAL DATA  Status post right lumpectomy with a diagnosis of intraductal carcinoma and positive margins  Patient presents for a mastectomy and reconstruction                                                                                      FINAL DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY  1  SCANT DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  2  BIOPSY SITE WITH FAT NECROSIS AND GIANT CELL REACTION TO SUTURE  3  FIBROCYSTIC CHANGES  Note  One duct in a section of the lateral margin shows pagetoid spread of ductal carcinoma  Diagnosis by  Lawrence R  Zukerberg  M D  Signed On  10 REMOVED_MONTH 93 at 19 48                                                                                 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  is a simple mastectomy specimen  measuring 10 x 10 x 4cm with an overlying skin ellipse of 6cm in length with a variable width of 2 to 4cm  The areola is 1cm in average dimension  The skin is grossly unremarkable except for a superior well healed scar of 4cm which is 3 to 4cm superior to the areola  Deep to the scar  2 to 5cm is a biopsy cavity of red tan tissue  The biopsy cavity is surrounded by firm  white  focal  hemorrhagic tan tissue interspersed with adipose tissue  Just lateral to the biopsy site is abundant  firm  white  fibrous breast parenchyma which contains small cysts less than 1mm in average dimension  SECTION CODE  A E  inferior lateral superior medial posterior margins respectively F L  representative tissue near and around biopsy site  M R  representative parecnhyma lateral to biopsy site  S T  areola and skin Resident  Rex Neal Smith  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Irene Kuter  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT    report_end  , Not_reported.
