entified  In the same container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm unremarkable skin ellipse  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section through large nodule to posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Section through large nodule to skin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Large nodule to fat   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional representative sections through nodule   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Cavity to closest margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional sections of cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   One lymph node   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue between the two lesions   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue distant from both lesions   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue around one biopsy site  Final Diagnosis by Frederick Carl Koerner M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMY  report_end  , No.
