r margin J  superior inferior Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right axillary contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm portion of yellow lobulated fatty tissue which contains multiple tan red lymph nodes ranging from 0 3cm to l1 2cm in greatest dimension  Sections are submitted as follows  K  one bisected lymph node L  one whole lymph node M  three whole lymph nodes N  three whole lymph nodes O  one bisected lymph node P  two whole lymph nodes Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final shaved margin medial half of cavity  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of yellow lobulated fatty tissue fragments which are serially sectioned and entirely submitted as Q T  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final shaved margin lateral of cavity  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm aggregate of yellow lobulated fatty tissue fragments which are serially sectioned and entirely submitted as U X  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  additonal axillary tissue  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm portion of yellow lobulated fatty tissue which is submitted in toto as Y  Gross Description by  LORI MARINI Resident  MANCONG ZHANG  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Alphonse Taghian  M D  W B Jerry Younger  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT ADDITIONAL AXILLARY   EXCISIONAL BIO PART C  BREAST  RIGHT MEDIAL   FINAL MARGIN PART D  BREAST  RIGHT LATERAL   FINAL MARGIN PART E  BREAST  ADDITIONAL AXILLARY TISSUE   EXCISION , No.
